// A caller and a callee in every language the code graph reads, so the test can
// check the whole path: extraction, resolution, and an edge in the store that
// points at the declaration the caller actually names.
//
// The names are unique per language on purpose. A `helper` in six languages is
// ambiguous across the repository, and each would be left unresolved for a
// reason that has nothing to do with the language being read correctly.
/** label -> [calleeFile, calleeSource, callerFile, callerSource, expectedCallee] */
